<title>USA: Global Payment sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Global Payment sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY STREAM, N.Y. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Payment Technologies Inc said on Thursday that it set a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split in the form of a stock dividend will be distributed on September 4 to shareholders of record as of August 18, the company said in a news release.  It will increase the number of outstanding shares to 5.5 million from 2.75 million.</p>
<p>Global makes paper currency validation systems.</p>
<p>The company's shares were trading up one to 19 in early Nasdaq trading. Their year high was 19-1/4.</p>
